WEBVTT

01:03.188 --> 01:05.982
GENIE, MAKE A WISH

01:07.609 --> 01:10.612
I thought I saw rage.

01:12.572 --> 01:13.406
This is…

01:17.452 --> 01:18.369
the face…

01:20.580 --> 01:21.623
of remorse.

01:23.833 --> 01:25.126
True sorrow.

01:26.377 --> 01:29.464
I will now also give sorrow to you.

01:32.258 --> 01:35.637
I will give you sorrow,
which is more precious than love.

01:36.221 --> 01:39.641
"On a winter's night, with a few
tangerines laid out on the street

01:39.724 --> 01:41.392
sold by an old woman shivering…"

01:44.270 --> 01:46.648
What is this? Why do I got to read this?

01:48.858 --> 01:49.984
Just read the book.

01:50.527 --> 01:53.655
Read this poem every day,
ten times without fail.

01:54.823 --> 01:56.991
Grandma hopes her darling Ka-young,

01:57.826 --> 02:00.745
her sweet, darling, happy granddaughter

02:01.788 --> 02:04.290
will one day burst into tears
with longing,

02:05.208 --> 02:07.293
and burst out laughing with joy.

02:08.002 --> 02:09.379
That's what I want for you.

02:09.963 --> 02:11.339
Once more, okay? Hmm?

02:12.549 --> 02:15.260
To you, who was happy
to haggle the price of tangerines…

02:15.343 --> 02:16.886
DESPAIR

02:17.720 --> 02:19.305
LONGING

02:20.140 --> 02:23.226
…I shall show you
the equal face of sorrow.

02:28.106 --> 02:30.608
When I called to you from the shadows…

02:34.279 --> 02:36.948
…not once did you show me an equal smile.

02:38.867 --> 02:42.036
When someone huddled under a straw sack
freezes to death,

02:43.163 --> 02:46.082
you did not so much as put
a single straw over them.

02:48.168 --> 02:49.794
For your indifferent love…

02:53.089 --> 02:55.800
for your tears
that seem incapable of flowing.

03:10.773 --> 03:12.775
Iblis does not have the heart
you think he does.

03:13.359 --> 03:16.404
His sole purpose is to hoodwink humans
and drag them to Hell.

03:16.487 --> 03:18.740
The only thing he can give you
is hell itself.

03:19.866 --> 03:22.118
So, if you could please
just make a virtuous wish.

03:22.202 --> 03:23.286
By the way…

03:25.455 --> 03:29.167
I will now also give blame to you.

03:29.250 --> 03:30.960
You didn't intervene, did you?

03:31.920 --> 03:32.837
You're an angel.

03:33.713 --> 03:36.049
A young boy and a young girl
were both dying…

03:38.218 --> 03:39.802
and you left them on their own?

03:40.887 --> 03:42.096
I prayed, of course.

03:42.972 --> 03:45.266
I am His warrior first
and His angel second.

03:45.350 --> 03:46.434
His warrior?

03:48.228 --> 03:49.062
Well,

03:49.896 --> 03:52.148
I'm a mechanic
who beats up bastards like you.

04:02.784 --> 04:04.369
Oh. Careful.

04:06.037 --> 04:07.205
Whoa, furniture?

04:08.206 --> 04:10.667
Where did all this come from?

04:12.293 --> 04:13.670
It just kind of gathered.

04:14.629 --> 04:16.089
You feel okay now?

04:16.172 --> 04:17.715
I never felt my heart in pain before.

04:18.341 --> 04:19.259
Any chance…

04:20.718 --> 04:23.680
that you saw me weeping blood
before my detainment?

04:24.264 --> 04:27.350
No. You were the one making the humans
weep blood, that's for sure.

04:27.433 --> 04:28.268
Oh.

04:29.352 --> 04:32.438
Did you see if I was ever with
a woman before?

04:32.522 --> 04:36.734
I wouldn't know. You were always flitting
from one jar to the next.

04:37.527 --> 04:39.195
Are you sure it wasn't Jinniya?

04:39.779 --> 04:40.697
It wasn't her.

04:44.659 --> 04:48.371
Why do I see that lump's face?
What a strange thing to happen.

04:50.915 --> 04:53.584
Hey, by the way,
when did that start flowing?

04:53.668 --> 04:54.585
Flowing?

04:57.797 --> 04:58.840
Oh, boy.

04:59.465 --> 05:01.384
It was simply contained
for almost 1,000 years.

05:01.467 --> 05:03.511
Why is it flowing now?
It wasn't doing it earlier.

05:03.594 --> 05:06.806
-Why is it? Do you know?
-Oh, well, don't you think…

05:07.390 --> 05:10.685
It is Master who is bottled up in here,
right? Then it can only mean one thing.

05:10.768 --> 05:13.563
It's the amount of time left
for you to corrupt her.

05:13.646 --> 05:16.816
Your heart must have hurt
because this started flowing.

05:16.899 --> 05:18.234
Your time is running out!

05:18.985 --> 05:20.153
Is that really it?

05:23.573 --> 05:25.658
Was that a small sampling
of what death is like?

05:27.243 --> 05:28.536
So how much time is left?

05:29.037 --> 05:30.705
Is this all I have remaining?

05:32.206 --> 05:33.333
A fistful of sand?

05:36.919 --> 05:38.129
Iblis was in pain?

05:38.713 --> 05:40.506
Yes, according to my magpies.

05:41.507 --> 05:43.968
They say everything within reach
burned into a pile of ash.

05:44.052 --> 05:46.095
An actual pile of ash? It was that bad?

05:47.555 --> 05:49.057
I see. Why is that?

05:50.058 --> 05:52.810
-Because I took his master to her past?
-What?

05:53.936 --> 05:56.105
The timing suggests that's the case.

05:56.814 --> 05:58.775
But why did you show Ki Ka-young
her past life?

05:58.858 --> 06:01.402
I wanted her to be so utterly enraged
by her past death

06:01.486 --> 06:03.571
that she pursued vengeance via good wish.

06:04.447 --> 06:05.823
But it was pointless.

06:06.532 --> 06:07.533
That woman…

06:08.701 --> 06:10.661
…she gleaned the truth.

06:12.080 --> 06:15.333
Not her own demise,
but Iblis grieving a mortal's death.

06:16.793 --> 06:19.337
The contract was important.

06:20.463 --> 06:22.548
Wait, she even learned
there's a 20-year difference?

06:22.632 --> 06:23.966
No, she doesn't know that.

06:25.093 --> 06:27.678
But I'm right in concluding
that pressuring her was wrong.

06:28.596 --> 06:30.473
And her lifespan has changed too.

06:36.145 --> 06:37.063
Her lifespan?

06:39.232 --> 06:42.610
I will stop the blizzard
of snow that fell on the world.

06:44.779 --> 06:47.532
I will take the spring snow
that fell on the barley fields.

06:51.119 --> 06:54.414
And take them to visit the sorrow
of the people shivering with cold.

06:55.415 --> 06:58.543
I will walk the snowy paths
no longer snowing with you.

07:12.348 --> 07:13.391
It was getting late.

07:14.767 --> 07:16.227
I was just visiting a friend.

07:18.896 --> 07:21.232
We will talk of the power of sorrow,

07:22.984 --> 07:25.611
and walk all the way
to the sorrow of waiting.

07:38.791 --> 07:41.252
Call me back. You busy?
It's Gu Bo-gyeong.

07:42.587 --> 07:44.172
Hose that fire under your butt.

07:49.427 --> 07:52.638
This is around 1041 AD.

07:54.098 --> 07:56.434
An inexplicable gap of 20 years.

08:11.073 --> 08:12.200
Shit.

08:12.283 --> 08:15.203
Are you still messing around
in here? Seriously?

08:15.286 --> 08:18.164
I knew this would happen.
She's not just any mortal.

08:18.247 --> 08:21.584
Her wish will be a righteous one,
she'll spread it out there,

08:21.667 --> 08:23.753
and that's it, Master's throat gets slit.

08:23.836 --> 08:26.756
I knew this is how it would happen.

08:28.174 --> 08:29.759
You should have said so then.

08:31.135 --> 08:32.428
Don't mention that word.

08:32.512 --> 08:35.264
No words that start with "right."
I've got things cooking!

08:35.348 --> 08:36.724
Really? Like what?

08:38.809 --> 08:41.395
This love thing,
this is what drives humans

08:41.479 --> 08:44.774
to long, cry, laugh, thrive
and then be demolished.

08:45.399 --> 08:48.319
I'll instill them in her.
Joy, sorrow, waiting, craving.

08:48.945 --> 08:51.739
And if it can be done, even love.

08:52.532 --> 08:57.203
Uh, that's not exactly how that works.

08:57.286 --> 09:00.081
I shall implant love in you,
who has no emotions,

09:00.164 --> 09:02.583
but you will not have me,
and will thus fall into despair.

09:02.667 --> 09:05.753
Do not hold me back.
I will use the strength of love

09:07.213 --> 09:09.423
to enact revenge on you.

09:09.507 --> 09:12.176
So what's the plan exactly?

09:13.219 --> 09:15.555
Firstly, I must impress her.

09:16.138 --> 09:18.140
-On that matter…
-Don't be so ridiculous.

09:18.224 --> 09:20.142
Can you buy me time at the internet cafe?

09:20.226 --> 09:23.187
GORYEO ARABIAN MERCHANTS

09:23.271 --> 09:24.939
THE RAPID PROGRESS OF GORYEO SOCIETY

09:28.734 --> 09:31.153
ABBASID MERCHANTS OFFERED TRIBUTES

09:31.237 --> 09:33.990
But the trade stopped after the year 1040.

09:34.073 --> 09:36.701
They didn't say why.
I guess the path was blocked?

09:37.827 --> 09:39.829
Your second wish has also been fulfilled.

09:39.912 --> 09:41.956
Path between the desert
and Goryeo has been blocked

09:42.039 --> 09:44.333
because of tsunamis and earthquakes.

09:46.085 --> 09:48.379
I caused that with my wish?

10:00.766 --> 10:02.184
What's stopping you from saying it?

10:02.268 --> 10:04.312
"This genie's declared his loyalty.
I owe him!"

10:07.565 --> 10:08.941
Turn off the music.

10:09.025 --> 10:10.568
Looking for another beating? That it?

10:10.651 --> 10:13.571
Oh, I see. I got it wrong, didn't I?

10:13.654 --> 10:16.198
The catchphrase is, "Hey, just say it."

10:16.782 --> 10:18.659
Felt so uncouth, you know?

10:18.743 --> 10:22.038
That writer of that show is crazy.

10:22.121 --> 10:23.914
Hey! That writer is the best.

10:25.249 --> 10:27.418
-Huh?
-Shut up already!

10:30.796 --> 10:34.300
It's not over? What, are you expecting
a sequined tracksuit and foam on your--

10:36.344 --> 10:38.471
Oh, no. This one's worse than I thought.

10:41.140 --> 10:43.851
You've got this, Ki Ka-young! Bravo!

10:45.144 --> 10:48.439
So amazing, Ka-young! Whoo!

10:54.195 --> 10:56.155
I considered both,
but I guess neither works.

11:00.493 --> 11:01.410
Don't tell me you're…

11:01.494 --> 11:02.745
CHOI YOUNG-DO

11:04.580 --> 11:06.832
I really didn't want it to come to this.

11:06.916 --> 11:09.752
It seems I have no alternative
as my life is on the line.

11:12.505 --> 11:16.092
Why do you point things like that?
I feel compelled to protect you.

11:19.178 --> 11:20.262
That's actually convincing.

11:21.514 --> 11:23.099
Ugh, whatever.

11:23.182 --> 11:24.141
Take a seat, kid.

11:24.850 --> 11:26.060
Whoa.

11:26.769 --> 11:28.396
Did I manage to spark something?

11:31.607 --> 11:34.652
About my past life, when I died…

11:34.735 --> 11:35.861
Yeah?

11:35.945 --> 11:37.697
…didn't you detest me back then?

11:39.240 --> 11:42.576
What, are you saying that I don't?
Can't you see it on my face?

11:48.249 --> 11:50.876
I don't believe I can.

11:53.587 --> 11:54.839
Well, I'm good at hiding.

11:56.257 --> 11:59.593
The expression you showed me
was definitely profound sorrow.

12:00.219 --> 12:04.056
The only people who've made faces
like that to me are Grandma and Min-ji.

12:04.765 --> 12:07.643
They say that kind of thing
is called a stab to the heart.

12:09.854 --> 12:12.064
-So what stabbed your heart?
-What are you saying?

12:12.148 --> 12:13.858
What could you have possibly seen?

12:14.984 --> 12:17.319
I wonder. Are there girl genies too?

12:18.154 --> 12:22.700
Huh? Well, what if there are? Why?

12:23.534 --> 12:25.286
-Are there?
-Jinniya?

12:25.369 --> 12:28.497
Uh, of course there are.
That's what we call female genies.

12:28.581 --> 12:30.916
Jinniya.

12:31.000 --> 12:32.126
Have you seen one?

12:34.754 --> 12:37.840
-Years ago.
-Did you date?

12:40.342 --> 12:43.053
Years ago.

12:43.721 --> 12:49.268
It was… Uh, I mean, it was before Christ,
and I was just a baby back then, and, uh…

12:49.852 --> 12:52.897
I got it. Go put that face on
when you're admiring your Jinniya.

12:53.814 --> 12:56.317
Oh. I'm not sure how.

12:56.400 --> 12:59.612
I wasn't even using this face then.
It was arranged in a…

13:00.321 --> 13:02.406
The eyes, the nose, the mouth,
were all different.

13:04.200 --> 13:06.786
How? A different number
of mouths, eyes, nose, what?

13:10.956 --> 13:14.919
I don't suppose the genie
that controls the rain is Jinniya?

13:15.503 --> 13:16.712
It must have poured every day.

13:18.422 --> 13:19.256
Huh?

13:21.675 --> 13:23.385
-Did you kiss?
-Uh…

13:24.303 --> 13:27.223
The-- The eyes, the nose, the mouth
were arranged different, okay?

13:27.723 --> 13:29.433
These lips were different in those days.

13:30.059 --> 13:34.438
Ah! Ah. Oh, darn, I just remembered.
I'm late. I'll see you at home in a bit.

13:36.398 --> 13:37.691
Yeah, he kissed her.

13:37.775 --> 13:38.776
Coward!

13:44.657 --> 13:46.784
That woman, she gleaned the truth.

13:46.867 --> 13:50.329
Not her own demise,
but Iblis grieving a mortal's death.

13:57.628 --> 13:59.296
It's been a while, Iblis.

13:59.380 --> 14:03.217
I should be saying that to you. It's been
quite a while since I've seen you.

14:03.801 --> 14:07.596
My dear Irem, you spent every day
for 983 years

14:07.680 --> 14:11.517
accompanying your master as he poured sand
over where my lamp was buried.

14:13.018 --> 14:15.688
-So, do you have something to request?
-A small favor.

14:16.772 --> 14:19.441
Do you know the place and vessel
Jinniya is inhabiting these days?

14:19.942 --> 14:23.112
It'd be great if you could find out,
and keep this a secret.

14:23.195 --> 14:24.029
Thank you.

14:32.705 --> 14:35.291
Mark down any items approaching
the expiration date.

14:35.374 --> 14:36.208
-Okay?
-Ah, yes, sir.

14:40.212 --> 14:41.922
Sir. When did you…

14:42.840 --> 14:45.134
I was scheduled
with a new supplier earlier.

14:45.718 --> 14:47.678
Ten minutes to break time,
I see how it is.

14:47.761 --> 14:50.472
Seems you view the workplace
as a brunch cafe, Branch Manager Kang.

14:51.974 --> 14:53.809
Well, who's this new supplier?

14:53.893 --> 14:55.978
Timing is right,
so might as well meet them too.

14:56.812 --> 15:00.816
Oh. Well…
it was a family situation actually.

15:00.900 --> 15:03.110
I'm so terribly sorry. I have no excuse.

15:03.736 --> 15:05.070
You're groveling over this?

15:06.071 --> 15:09.366
Branch Manager Kang, you can't
be apologizing for tiny things like this.

15:09.450 --> 15:11.911
You're a manager. Take responsibility.

15:11.994 --> 15:14.538
Your reputation is awful,
your sales are awful.

15:14.622 --> 15:16.457
Even your work ethic is fucking garbage.

15:17.207 --> 15:19.793
-Sir, I--
-You weren't even aware I was coming.

15:19.877 --> 15:22.630
Not one subordinate filled you in
or gave you a hint.

15:22.713 --> 15:25.758
How did you even become manager
in the first place, huh?

15:25.841 --> 15:27.426
You make a pact with the devil?

15:28.302 --> 15:30.679
Twenty years is a lot
for someone at your level.

15:31.305 --> 15:33.057
You may leave your resignation
on your desk.

15:33.140 --> 15:35.059
We don't need
an official handover from you.

15:36.477 --> 15:38.896
I heard the Korean thistle rice
is good here in Cheongpung.

15:38.979 --> 15:40.481
Oh, yes, sir.

15:44.443 --> 15:47.321
Kang Im-seon, stop!
What are you doing? Are you insane?

15:47.404 --> 15:49.114
Oh, my gosh! Oh!

15:50.157 --> 15:52.660
This is my resignation letter,
like you asked.

15:53.577 --> 15:57.331
Seeing as you won't be needing
a handover, I'm out of here, bitches.

15:58.040 --> 16:00.167
I've got to finish my pact with the devil.

16:06.298 --> 16:07.174
What--

16:16.600 --> 16:19.812
I will help you.
I'll help you find your family.

16:20.354 --> 16:22.106
No prying, I promise.

16:23.440 --> 16:27.486
So, why don't we stop tracking car models
and try to remember your past?

16:28.070 --> 16:28.904
My past?

16:33.075 --> 16:34.201
"Let's go for a walk!"

16:38.664 --> 16:41.250
"That Shih Tzu is so noisy! Stop whining!"

16:42.251 --> 16:44.628
The woman in 904 is freaky. Mm.

16:46.422 --> 16:48.340
The building was named…

16:49.925 --> 16:52.511
Veteran? V… Veggie…

16:55.180 --> 16:56.849
Dr. Kim, watch out.

16:57.975 --> 17:00.102
"Veggie"?

17:01.103 --> 17:01.937
Hmm.

17:05.524 --> 17:09.737
Valet, veal, vegetable, veterinarian?

17:10.904 --> 17:12.406
There's a chance he was mistaken.

17:12.489 --> 17:15.701
If Dr. Kim was a doctor,
then his surname is Kim.

17:15.784 --> 17:16.618
Oh.

17:16.702 --> 17:17.661
THE ANIMAL HOSPITAL

17:17.745 --> 17:18.620
Bingo!

17:18.704 --> 17:22.791
I got it. Let's go. If we book it,
we can make it there by four o'clock.

17:24.126 --> 17:25.002
Really?

17:30.841 --> 17:34.803
Um, you sure this is the right place?

17:34.887 --> 17:35.971
This is the place.

17:36.764 --> 17:39.933
Mm. Absolutely. The scent from the vet
led me here.

17:40.517 --> 17:41.810
Thank you, Chauffeur Kim.

17:45.397 --> 17:48.025
Looks like it's been at least three days
since they were here.

17:49.485 --> 17:50.486
I'm going to wait.

17:51.236 --> 17:52.071
I will.

17:52.696 --> 17:53.530
"Good boy."

17:57.451 --> 17:59.036
I can smell my brother.

18:05.793 --> 18:09.505
Could it be that
his family treated him as poorly as a dog?

18:10.714 --> 18:12.716
Those sons of bitches!

18:19.848 --> 18:23.644
Maybe we moved to a town that's too dull.

18:25.604 --> 18:27.481
Nothing to vlog about…

18:27.564 --> 18:29.358
Oh, it's so boring here.

18:31.735 --> 18:34.988
Hmm? What's that? A phisher?

18:35.989 --> 18:37.741
Click. Mm.

18:37.825 --> 18:40.994
I AM GENIE, THE LAMP SPIRIT.
I SHALL GRANT YOU…

18:41.078 --> 18:42.663
What the… A genie?

18:43.789 --> 18:45.582
These emojis really suck balls, man.

18:45.666 --> 18:47.126
I SHALL GRANT THREE WISHES…

18:47.668 --> 18:51.004
WHATEVER. I'LL DM YOU THE DETAILS,
SO JUST MAKE A WISH.

18:51.713 --> 18:53.674
Mm, is Da-jin trying to trick me?

18:54.174 --> 18:57.177
Oh, okay. Let's do it, why not?

18:57.970 --> 18:59.054
Let's see.

18:59.638 --> 19:03.725
I'm looking for something to film
that will make waves. It's boring here.

19:04.476 --> 19:05.811
It's so damn quiet.

19:05.894 --> 19:08.897
SO WHAT? YOU WANT ME
TO MAKE A RACKET IN THE VILLAGE?

19:08.981 --> 19:12.818
These small towns always have
some kind of, you know… Right.

19:13.694 --> 19:17.030
Something like a… a mystery or crime
within the village.

19:22.494 --> 19:24.997
"It's been fulfilled"? What shit is this?

19:25.080 --> 19:27.916
Hey, it's got to go through
the algorithm. I'm not a--

19:31.044 --> 19:33.130
Oh, damn it. What the hell?

19:38.177 --> 19:39.511
Huh? Where am I?

19:39.595 --> 19:42.055
What's going on? What's happening?

19:44.516 --> 19:46.226
When did the live turn on?

19:48.437 --> 19:50.022
Okay, hey, everyone.

19:50.105 --> 19:52.941
Okay, I've… I've had a few drinks…

19:53.525 --> 19:54.651
Huh?

19:54.735 --> 19:56.862
Oh. No, I didn't fall down.

19:56.945 --> 19:59.740
I was already lying down--

20:02.701 --> 20:05.329
Ah, damn it, why is there a hole here?

20:08.582 --> 20:09.416
Huh?

20:10.626 --> 20:12.336
Mm? What, is something there?

20:13.253 --> 20:15.339
Ah, your wish is my command.

20:15.881 --> 20:17.507
All right. Okay.

20:17.591 --> 20:19.801
Thanks to you guys,
I'm digging through the dirt

20:19.885 --> 20:22.346
in the middle of the night.
What are you saying was there?

20:24.014 --> 20:24.848
Oh.

20:26.767 --> 20:27.935
What is this?

20:29.394 --> 20:32.189
What the fuck?

20:32.272 --> 20:33.607
END OF LIVESTREAM

20:34.191 --> 20:35.817
Oh, shit, shit! Shit!

20:35.901 --> 20:36.944
SWEETHEART

20:37.027 --> 20:40.739
Da-jin! Da-jin!

20:40.822 --> 20:43.242
-I found a skull--
-Get back online.

20:44.159 --> 20:47.412
Go live again, you idiot!
There were over 100 viewers!

20:47.496 --> 20:48.664
Huh?

20:51.208 --> 20:52.209
Huh?

20:53.335 --> 20:54.169
Uh…

20:56.505 --> 20:59.174
Oh… Holy shit!

21:02.928 --> 21:05.180
Whoo!

21:05.264 --> 21:07.641
…serious crime. Who discovered it?

21:07.724 --> 21:09.184
Me. One and only, Ko Yeong-hyeon.

21:09.268 --> 21:10.310
BACK AT THE SKELETON SITE!

21:10.394 --> 21:11.687
I discovered the body.

21:11.770 --> 21:14.648
What were you doing around there?
The middle of the night, drunk too?

21:14.731 --> 21:15.565
Oh?

21:16.775 --> 21:17.609
Uh…

21:18.819 --> 21:20.112
I AM GENIE, THE LAMP SPIRIT

21:20.195 --> 21:21.530
IT'S BEEN FULFILLED.

21:23.156 --> 21:24.283
No way.

21:25.492 --> 21:26.368
The genie?

21:26.451 --> 21:28.370
I heard from the police chief.

21:28.453 --> 21:31.164
It looks like that dead body
is just a skeleton.

21:33.000 --> 21:35.335
You should all stay home at night
if you can.

21:35.419 --> 21:38.005
If you have to go out,
make sure you don't go out alone.

21:38.088 --> 21:40.382
Oh, this is scary.

21:41.133 --> 21:43.927
Where did this trouble come from
in our little town?

21:44.011 --> 21:45.012
I know.

21:48.223 --> 21:50.517
-She owns the repair shop.
-Bite down.

21:50.600 --> 21:53.687
No way she only killed one.
It's just they've only found one so far.

21:53.770 --> 21:55.897
I heard she's always been a psychopath.

21:55.981 --> 21:58.442
-They should investigate her shop.
-Just a minute.

21:58.525 --> 21:59.735
It wasn't Ka-young.

22:00.235 --> 22:03.030
Where do you get off saying
such horseshit lies?

22:03.739 --> 22:05.198
I'll not be treating you. Leave.

22:05.282 --> 22:08.243
You can't speak to us like that.
We'll take our business somewhere else.

22:08.327 --> 22:12.497
Yes, so get out of here,
or I'll report you to the police, okay?

22:12.581 --> 22:14.833
We weren't claiming anything ridiculous.

22:14.916 --> 22:17.377
How dare she shout at her clients!

22:28.013 --> 22:29.222
Goodness.

22:34.478 --> 22:35.395
There. That one.

22:37.731 --> 22:40.776
I wonder if Pan-geum
knows what's going on here,

22:40.859 --> 22:41.943
wherever she is.

22:42.611 --> 22:45.072
Do you know why
she still hasn't come back?

22:45.155 --> 22:48.533
She's abandoned her granddaughter.
She's run off.

22:48.617 --> 22:50.660
Ka-young was hiding behind her grandma,

22:50.744 --> 22:53.413
pretending to function
like a normal human being.

22:53.497 --> 22:55.582
We all just looked the other way.

22:55.665 --> 22:59.503
Let's be honest, Ka-young is
the most suspicious of anyone.

22:59.586 --> 23:02.130
You think people can
actually change inside?

23:02.214 --> 23:04.341
You're spouting nonsense.

23:05.092 --> 23:07.427
I used to be a soldier. I'm all over this.

23:07.511 --> 23:09.346
All that was left was a skeleton.

23:09.429 --> 23:11.473
It takes 20 years
for a corpse to decompose.

23:11.556 --> 23:13.683
Wasn't Miss Ki barely eight years old
20 years ago?

23:14.434 --> 23:16.061
How does an eight-year-old kill someone?

23:16.144 --> 23:18.480
She could do it if she wanted to. Huh?

23:18.563 --> 23:20.982
She's for sure got all sorts of stuff
in her garage.

23:21.066 --> 23:23.902
Stuff that could melt flesh into liquid.
Stuff like that.

23:23.985 --> 23:26.905
You've always had
a vivid imagination, Ms. Park.

23:33.078 --> 23:35.080
What's wrong? Why are you crying again?

23:35.831 --> 23:36.873
Who died this time?

23:43.797 --> 23:46.800
Ka-young, no matter
what the villagers say,

23:48.385 --> 23:50.137
if they suspect you or anything…

23:51.930 --> 23:53.890
you cannot ever harm them, understand?

23:54.516 --> 23:56.810
Why are you saying this? I didn't do it.

23:58.687 --> 24:00.188
Of course, darling Ka-young.

24:00.814 --> 24:02.482
I know that, I do.

24:03.066 --> 24:06.611
It's the other people who don't get it.
They could accuse you of bad things.

24:07.237 --> 24:10.657
You crying makes me angrier
than any of that. Stop it.

24:12.409 --> 24:14.619
All right. I won't cry.

24:15.120 --> 24:18.540
My tears are all… …dried up.

24:18.623 --> 24:21.376
Oh, gosh. Gosh, I'm so out of it.

24:22.002 --> 24:25.172
I bought some pollack to make
spicy fish stew, but forgot the greens.

24:25.255 --> 24:27.257
I'll get it. Don't go out
if you don't have to.

24:28.550 --> 24:30.177
Right. You can start the broth.

24:53.366 --> 24:55.911
I called you 30 times.
You never called back.

24:58.371 --> 24:59.623
Why did you call anyway?

25:00.207 --> 25:01.917
Come to the bank now and explain yourself.

25:02.000 --> 25:05.253
Don't pretend you don't know your money's
being transferred to my account.

25:05.337 --> 25:07.297
My accounts have been frozen
because of you.

25:07.380 --> 25:10.842
-This is proof of tax evasion.
-I didn't realize I was evading taxes.

25:12.135 --> 25:13.261
Don't play stupid.

25:13.345 --> 25:16.097
You transferred the funds
of your own free will, no matter why!

25:16.181 --> 25:17.140
That makes it a gift!

25:17.807 --> 25:21.144
So come to the bank and explain
how all these transfers were gifts.

25:22.062 --> 25:23.271
I'll report you otherwise.

25:24.814 --> 25:26.775
Report me?

25:28.109 --> 25:31.821
You're the one committing the crime,
and you're going to report me?

25:34.282 --> 25:37.869
You're a murderer. Everyone says
you killed that body they found.

25:38.954 --> 25:41.915
You seem to think you're so fucking cool,
but I could just kill you.

25:42.707 --> 25:44.292
How do you think I got your money, huh?

25:44.376 --> 25:46.836
It was a wish I made to a spirit,
a real life genie!

25:48.213 --> 25:51.675
I don't care if you believe me
or not, just deal with it.

25:52.509 --> 25:54.427
If you don't,
I'll wish to have you killed.

25:55.136 --> 25:57.264
Do it, then. Just kill me now.

25:59.975 --> 26:03.853
But you know, if I die now, Grandma's
going to receive all of that wealth.

26:03.937 --> 26:05.772
You won't keep one single penny
of that money.

26:06.356 --> 26:10.235
Oh, you're fucking batshit crazy!
You psychopathic asshole!

26:10.318 --> 26:12.070
Yes, psychopath, that's right.

26:12.779 --> 26:15.657
The advantage is, it's easier to choose
the wrong thing over the right.

26:16.199 --> 26:19.202
Still, I made the right choices
so I can be decent and kind.

26:19.995 --> 26:22.706
So, life, unfortunately,
has become annoyingly dull.

26:23.999 --> 26:24.916
You, though.

26:25.584 --> 26:29.004
You have no excuse, so why do you think
you can get away with these choices?

26:30.130 --> 26:32.465
If the bank reaches out,
I'll just say you were embezzling.

26:32.549 --> 26:35.802
It's the truth after all.
You could try pleading with the genie.

26:36.678 --> 26:41.433
But you know, no matter what, Bo-gyeong,
your wish will be forfeit. You know why?

26:41.516 --> 26:44.811
It's because whatever you wish for,
I'll just wish for it to be undone.

26:46.438 --> 26:47.731
The genie's my friend.

26:52.360 --> 26:54.863
You know, I still have
one wish remaining too.

26:56.656 --> 26:57.741
What?

27:03.580 --> 27:07.208
A clear example of corruption.
To think that Satan was right,

27:08.543 --> 27:10.503
about her and me too.

27:14.591 --> 27:15.425
You all right?

27:19.095 --> 27:20.722
About the whole village suspecting you.

27:22.182 --> 27:23.642
I've been suspected since childhood.

27:24.351 --> 27:26.978
After all, crime and psychopathy
are famously linked.

27:33.568 --> 27:36.905
What's the highest point
around the neighborhood?

27:50.794 --> 27:52.420
You can push me if you want.

27:52.921 --> 27:55.006
It's been a while since you've done that.

27:58.635 --> 28:00.762
It's too low.
There'll be no satisfying crunch.

28:01.763 --> 28:02.806
But you knew that.

28:06.768 --> 28:08.478
That's Cassiopeia up there.

28:09.938 --> 28:11.231
And that's Orion.

28:12.023 --> 28:15.318
Right. Everyone seems to know those two.
What about others?

28:16.820 --> 28:19.531
I see. Those are the two most popular.

28:19.614 --> 28:21.741
That's why that's all I found
when I researched it.

28:23.326 --> 28:24.911
Even genies have limited knowledge?

28:26.746 --> 28:28.665
Whoa! Wow!

28:29.791 --> 28:31.793
It looks like stars are raining down.

28:31.876 --> 28:34.879
Rain? No. We don't even have alcohol.

28:35.505 --> 28:38.675
And, most importantly,
you're not that pretty.

28:39.592 --> 28:42.804
I asked Min-ji about kisses again.
She said stars are secondary.

28:42.887 --> 28:45.640
It's how pretty the other one comes across
that counts.

28:46.349 --> 28:47.183
Oh, yeah?

28:47.767 --> 28:50.770
This face, the prettiest of all faces
since the dawn of Heaven and Earth,

28:50.854 --> 28:51.855
this face isn't pretty?

28:51.938 --> 28:52.772
Your hair part.

28:53.398 --> 28:55.692
Do you really need to have it
on that side?

28:55.775 --> 28:57.068
It looks like you're off-kilter.

28:58.069 --> 29:01.698
Come over to this side then, and look
at it from an angle, why don't you?

29:02.741 --> 29:06.119
I don't think I can.
My face is also off-kilter.

29:06.870 --> 29:09.497
Why can we never have
a normal conversation?

29:10.623 --> 29:13.835
I suppose you can lean on my shoulder.

29:13.918 --> 29:16.129
Or, I could tousle your hair?

29:16.629 --> 29:19.591
Or, I'll wear a coat and strut over.

29:25.263 --> 29:26.139
What's happening?

29:29.684 --> 29:33.313
The hair part can't change. I've invested
too much into my looks already.

29:34.397 --> 29:36.858
-Let's go with the first one.
-Uh, the first what?

29:38.568 --> 29:40.195
Ah. The shoulder.

29:42.238 --> 29:43.072
Here.

29:46.451 --> 29:50.455
Whoa! Damn it! Hey, Ki Ka-young!

29:50.538 --> 29:54.918
Nice try! I gave you my shoulder
so you could push me off!

29:55.001 --> 29:57.921
Mm. Tends to safeguard his pride.

29:58.546 --> 29:59.380
Hmm.

30:03.802 --> 30:05.970
Where could she have gone
without her phone?

30:06.054 --> 30:08.181
Ka-young!

30:11.142 --> 30:14.312
Oh. Ka-young wasn't answering
her phone, so…

30:15.063 --> 30:18.525
You're living in this house here
for six months?

30:19.150 --> 30:20.860
Oh, well, you see…

30:23.112 --> 30:24.823
Ka-young is a…

30:25.448 --> 30:28.785
a younger close friend. Yes.

30:28.868 --> 30:31.329
Ka-young is a friend of yours?

30:33.206 --> 30:35.083
That's quite odd.

30:36.167 --> 30:37.502
Have you seen her by any chance?

30:38.336 --> 30:40.797
Yeah, but your hair part also isn't--

30:46.469 --> 30:47.762
What is this, Ka-young?

30:48.513 --> 30:51.307
Why is this man just letting himself
onto your property?

30:51.933 --> 30:54.477
And why is this lady
randomly staying here?

30:57.355 --> 30:58.189
She's a close--

30:58.273 --> 31:01.359
I'll kill you if you pretend
she's a close older friend.

31:01.442 --> 31:04.070
I've known you for 14 years,
even when away at school.

31:04.153 --> 31:06.489
Every Wednesday,
you'd go from Daejeon to Seoul

31:06.573 --> 31:09.450
to have gamja-tang with me,
and now you have a new friend?

31:09.534 --> 31:11.327
Maybe you can help out like last time?

31:11.995 --> 31:13.746
You're saying
you didn't think this through?

31:14.539 --> 31:18.418
-You mean you lied about being smart?
-Classy choice of words.

31:18.501 --> 31:21.170
You, don't move an inch.
I'll call the police.

31:22.672 --> 31:26.092
Look, everyone's going on
about that skeleton they found.

31:26.593 --> 31:28.344
Ki Ka-young, come on.

31:29.178 --> 31:32.015
-Oh, uh…
-Oh, ooh, my brother!

31:33.224 --> 31:35.393
Oh.

31:37.729 --> 31:40.899
My brother is visiting
from the Middle East.

31:41.691 --> 31:43.151
So I came to visit.

31:43.234 --> 31:48.698
Yeah. Lee Mi-ju. Lee Beul-li.
I'm his sister. Family.

31:49.991 --> 31:51.743
"Family"?

31:53.578 --> 31:55.872
I know what's going on.

31:56.414 --> 31:59.125
Bong Joon-ho's
Oscar-winning film, Parasite.

31:59.208 --> 32:02.587
You're worming in new family members
until you completely take over.

32:03.254 --> 32:04.964
Although, this house has no cellar.

32:05.840 --> 32:07.717
What about the shed?
Anyone maybe hiding there?

32:19.395 --> 32:20.438
No way.

32:21.064 --> 32:23.816
Come over here.

32:24.776 --> 32:27.070
IDs. All you people, right now.

32:27.654 --> 32:29.113
Mm. True loyalty.

32:29.781 --> 32:31.783
Of course, brat. This is loyalty.

32:32.450 --> 32:33.618
Get moving already.

32:34.202 --> 32:36.829
I told you to show me your IDs. Right now!

32:38.873 --> 32:42.085
I won't tell you right now.
No matter how much you ask, I won't.

32:42.168 --> 32:43.878
But I will tell you everything later.

32:43.962 --> 32:46.214
Just don't ask me anything
about the siblings.

32:47.256 --> 32:49.634
If you ask me about them,
it would derail everything.

32:49.717 --> 32:50.843
And when is later?

32:50.927 --> 32:53.179
I don't know. Just later.

32:55.098 --> 32:58.101
Just have some faith.

32:59.852 --> 33:02.647
All right, I'm sure you have a reason.

33:02.730 --> 33:03.815
I believe you.

33:05.233 --> 33:07.610
Wait, there's also that other guy.

33:07.694 --> 33:10.196
Are you counting the one
who lives in the shed?

33:10.279 --> 33:14.784
Mm… Mm. He and Lee Beul-li are a set. Mm.

33:24.419 --> 33:26.879
Two female guests checked out
a few days early.

33:26.963 --> 33:29.090
-The town freaked them out.
-I know.

33:29.173 --> 33:30.008
Got the message.

33:30.591 --> 33:34.220
Oh, did something happen?
You look a bit tired.

33:34.303 --> 33:36.556
Well, you're being annoying,
so you should go turn in.

33:36.639 --> 33:38.766
All right.

33:40.560 --> 33:42.895
Always chopping firewood
despite the heat. Weirdo.

33:50.695 --> 33:52.071
Shit.

33:53.656 --> 33:57.326
What the hell
have they left behind this time?

33:58.036 --> 33:59.662
Oh, finally!

34:00.163 --> 34:03.166
It's come back, yes!
It's finally appeared again!

34:13.134 --> 34:15.762
Why have you only returned now?

34:15.845 --> 34:17.597
I went back out to where I hit that deer.

34:17.680 --> 34:19.891
I thought I had to be in that area
to see you again!

34:20.475 --> 34:22.602
Right. This is the second wish.

34:22.685 --> 34:26.773
I want to visit the 23rd of December,
at 11:40, 2004, 20 years ago.

34:33.696 --> 34:35.323
I just want to check on a thing.

34:41.162 --> 34:44.874
CHEONGPUNG VILLAGE HALL

34:44.957 --> 34:48.377
Wait, what? Why is it daylight?
I said to take me to 11:40!

34:48.461 --> 34:51.589
-11:40 is the middle of the day.
-Ah, damn it!

34:51.672 --> 34:54.509
Maybe you should've specified "p.m."
if you wanted to be here at night.

34:54.592 --> 34:56.636
Am I to just sit around
and wait for 12 hours?

34:56.719 --> 35:00.223
I'm impatient! This is so annoying!

35:00.306 --> 35:03.643
Darling Jeong-hwa,
do you like seeing Ka-young?

35:04.352 --> 35:06.938
Here, look. She smiles
when she's around you.

35:07.897 --> 35:10.483
You know, Ka-young,
all those people who say nasty things,

35:11.109 --> 35:14.904
they do that because they're suspicious.
Do you follow, little Ka-young?

35:20.284 --> 35:21.744
I'm confused. This is hard.

35:23.246 --> 35:28.084
To think that weirdo
will one day own the town repair shop.

35:28.167 --> 35:29.752
That brat is a psychopath.

35:30.336 --> 35:32.964
Well, since we have time,
how about we play hide-and-seek

35:33.047 --> 35:34.507
with that brat--

35:43.182 --> 35:45.935
What the hell was that, you asshole--

35:48.563 --> 35:51.107
Why do these mortals
always have unresolved issues?

35:54.026 --> 35:56.946
Where are you trying to go?
The exact destination.

35:57.989 --> 35:59.907
20 YEARS AGO, 23:39

35:59.991 --> 36:00.950
20 YEARS AGO, 23:40

36:01.033 --> 36:02.535
BLACK HAIR DYE

36:02.618 --> 36:05.580
Indeed. Absurd, dyeing your pretty hair.

36:06.372 --> 36:08.416
That color isn't very ladylike, is it?

36:09.709 --> 36:12.879
Huh. Got some on your face.

36:41.616 --> 36:43.910
Fuck. Shit, fuck.

36:50.791 --> 36:51.667
Damn it.

36:53.586 --> 36:54.629
Damn it.

36:56.005 --> 36:56.964
Ah, shit!

36:57.882 --> 36:59.592
Shit! Damn it!

37:01.427 --> 37:04.764
It was Mother. Just Mother.

37:04.847 --> 37:07.183
I knew someone had been there,

37:07.266 --> 37:09.894
but I couldn't understand
why they didn't call it in.

37:10.478 --> 37:14.565
No police involved, and I couldn't
figure out why.

37:16.359 --> 37:19.528
Does it bring you that much joy
to find out the witness to your sins

37:20.613 --> 37:21.572
was her?

37:21.656 --> 37:23.908
Mother would never turn me in anyway.

37:24.659 --> 37:27.578
She's looking out for me,
just like you are.

37:27.662 --> 37:31.123
Now I can relax. I can kill
more of those vulgar ones.

37:31.207 --> 37:33.960
And that way, the world
will be cleansed! Quickly!

37:37.672 --> 37:39.924
Is this how the lump of clay really felt?

37:40.841 --> 37:42.760
My logic was similar, I suppose.

37:44.011 --> 37:45.221
This is just appalling.

37:47.890 --> 37:51.352
EOM SANG-TAE, JULY 20, 2024
MADE HIS SECOND WISH

37:51.435 --> 37:55.982
WENT BACK 20 YEARS TO CONFIRM THE WITNESS

37:56.065 --> 38:00.278
THE WITNESS WAS HIS MOTHER

38:09.078 --> 38:10.871
You never said anything, Mother.

38:12.748 --> 38:14.375
I found out the truth.

38:15.042 --> 38:16.585
You saw me, Mother.

38:18.713 --> 38:23.134
If I had known earlier, I wouldn't have
held back on my urges for so long.

38:33.060 --> 38:34.729
He was doing what?

38:35.396 --> 38:37.273
He was dyeing the corpse's hair black.

38:38.441 --> 38:39.608
It had been red before.

38:40.568 --> 38:43.696
This son of a bitch is a serial killer.
Detectives stopped by the garage

38:43.779 --> 38:45.948
saying that a young woman
had recently vanished.

38:48.617 --> 38:49.785
BLACK HAIR DYE

38:49.869 --> 38:52.997
Given the circumstances, it's likely
the missing girl was his victim too.

38:55.374 --> 38:57.084
Either way, because of you,

38:57.168 --> 38:59.378
the perpetrator of a 20-year-old murder
has been found.

38:59.962 --> 39:03.507
I'm not the one responsible,
it's all because of your wish.

39:03.591 --> 39:06.719
I can kill him if you want. Say the word.
I'll fold him right in half.

39:07.303 --> 39:09.430
And then, send him down to Hell for you.

39:09.513 --> 39:11.974
No. We need to deal with this properly.

39:12.058 --> 39:15.186
This asshole needs to be locked away.
He can go to Hell after.

39:15.686 --> 39:18.105
Our chance will come when Eom Sang-tae
makes his final wish.

39:18.189 --> 39:20.358
That will serve us well.
I'll take care of this.

39:21.275 --> 39:23.778
I'm starting to really wonder.

39:24.862 --> 39:27.323
Will I actually be able to win this?

39:28.908 --> 39:31.410
"If Iblis decides
to bow his head to a human,

39:32.203 --> 39:34.538
you'll then slit your brother's throat."

39:36.791 --> 39:38.000
Is it that important to you?

39:39.377 --> 39:41.003
Grandma is now young again.

39:41.587 --> 39:43.172
Life has become dull and stale.

39:45.633 --> 39:46.634
I could let you win.

41:16.599 --> 41:18.309
-Hello. Welcome.
-Hello.

41:19.351 --> 41:20.269
Here we go.

41:23.939 --> 41:25.691
-What would you like?
-A small gamja-tang.

41:25.774 --> 41:29.111
-All right, with greens or aged kimchi?
-With greens, please.

41:29.195 --> 41:30.321
-Greens?
-Yes.

41:31.989 --> 41:33.866
Is that gamja-tang spot over there
for sale?

41:34.450 --> 41:37.328
Yes. How did you know? It's well below
market value. It's strange.

41:37.995 --> 41:39.955
Are you interested by chance, Miss Ki?

41:53.594 --> 41:55.471
Hello. I'm here.

41:56.931 --> 41:57.890
Eat up.

42:44.019 --> 42:46.647
Long time no see, Mr. Shadi.

42:46.730 --> 42:48.691
Why did you put the world to sleep?

42:48.774 --> 42:50.693
I was confident you would be nearby.

42:51.610 --> 42:54.697
And you being here means Ejllael
is not far from you, is he?

42:56.031 --> 42:59.868
I have no knowledge if Ejllael or Iblis
have any camaraderie,

43:00.744 --> 43:02.663
but I still abhor the traitor Ejllael,

43:03.998 --> 43:05.666
because he obliterated our brothers--

43:05.749 --> 43:09.211
I want to know if I have to stop you
from seeking out my benevolent master.

43:09.295 --> 43:12.298
You have nothing to fear.
This does not involve you in any way.

43:14.216 --> 43:15.426
The night is short.

43:17.219 --> 43:18.721
I will move how I please.

43:19.513 --> 43:21.765
I will only go visit whom I want to visit.

43:49.501 --> 43:51.670
We're in trouble, Ki Ka-young!

43:52.880 --> 43:54.673
We're in trouble, Ejllael!

43:58.093 --> 43:59.928
We're in trouble, Irem!

44:06.226 --> 44:07.102
Take a look.

44:07.645 --> 44:11.690
-Someone tied him up, and he can't move.
-What?

44:13.025 --> 44:14.735
This black string?

44:15.819 --> 44:17.571
You called us here
without trying to cut it?

44:17.655 --> 44:20.908
That's the first thing I tried,
but this is some super string.

44:20.991 --> 44:23.827
I swear, it's impossible to cut
and it's absurdly heavy.

44:23.911 --> 44:24.745
Really?

44:25.371 --> 44:28.749
I should buy a few of these.
These would really come in handy.

44:28.832 --> 44:30.250
Uh--

44:33.003 --> 44:36.173
Servant of my brother,
you're incapable of lying.

44:36.715 --> 44:39.802
Nobody else was free to roam last night.
Do you know anything?

44:39.885 --> 44:43.013
I… I may have run into Shadi last evening.

44:44.223 --> 44:48.811
He put the world to sleep. He was walking
slowly, like he couldn't lift his feet.

44:49.895 --> 44:52.690
-Little busy bee today, are we?
-Who's this Shadi?

44:52.773 --> 44:55.526
He's a brother of ours
who controls sleep with song.

44:55.609 --> 44:57.403
I know Shadi was here since I fell asleep,

44:57.486 --> 45:00.447
but it's just not conceivable
that Shadi's behind this.

45:00.531 --> 45:02.408
This…

45:02.491 --> 45:05.285
This is clearly not Shadi's doing.

45:05.869 --> 45:08.539
This string is special,
beyond any of my brothers' abilities.

45:10.040 --> 45:14.002
If they're your brother's… Do all genies
share the exact same birthday?

45:14.086 --> 45:15.754
Their birthdays are all Thursday.

45:15.838 --> 45:18.215
Mine is Wednesday,
and you were born on Friday.

45:18.298 --> 45:20.217
Excuse me, what do you know
about my birthday?

45:20.968 --> 45:22.886
I was born at dawn on a Saturday.

45:22.970 --> 45:25.514
That's not what that means.

45:25.597 --> 45:27.558
Can we focus on the task at hand?

45:28.392 --> 45:31.145
And you! You're chit-chatting
after getting here so late?

45:31.228 --> 45:33.439
You know I can only run
at 30 miles per hour.

45:33.522 --> 45:35.190
I can only get here so fast.

45:35.274 --> 45:38.235
Really? You do look quite tough
in your pictures on the web.

45:38.777 --> 45:41.697
That's right. I try to, you know,
to not show off too much.

45:41.780 --> 45:45.033
Shadi is the one who did this,
so can we figure out where he is?

45:45.117 --> 45:47.536
-Ejllael?
-Oh, please. You know he loathes me.

45:48.328 --> 45:50.664
Plus, that looks comfy.
Seems like an improvement.

45:50.748 --> 45:53.125
Once I'm out of these,
the first thing I'll do is kill you!

45:53.208 --> 45:55.586
Huh?

45:56.712 --> 45:58.005
-Oh, damn.
-Hmm?

46:05.554 --> 46:08.265
Ka-young! Did you…
did you cut my hand off?

46:08.348 --> 46:11.143
We can't cut the string,
so I tried cutting your hand off instead.

46:11.226 --> 46:13.604
Or should I have not done that?

46:14.229 --> 46:16.523
I know you've heard it all,
but it won't be so simple.

46:16.607 --> 46:17.441
Oh.

46:17.941 --> 46:19.485
-Oh!
-Whoa!

46:26.325 --> 46:29.703
How did… How did sh-- How did she do that?

46:29.787 --> 46:31.663
Who knows? I am pretty strong.

46:32.664 --> 46:34.249
Or maybe it's because I'm your master.

46:37.377 --> 46:39.671
The foodbank is in need of me.

46:42.508 --> 46:44.885
VAT settlements are due,
so, excuse me too.

46:44.968 --> 46:47.137
Where are you going?
Come back! I have questions!

46:48.639 --> 46:51.183
Uh, well, thank you.
I need to go grab her.

46:51.266 --> 46:54.353
By the way, I saw you left me
in the desert to decompose.

46:54.937 --> 46:55.938
I saw it all.

46:56.688 --> 46:59.525
Because the angel that just left
revealed the truth of my past death.

47:00.484 --> 47:02.361
That son of a… Uh--

47:04.154 --> 47:06.448
About that…

47:07.741 --> 47:11.119
the situation was, well…
Mm, well, a bit, you know…

47:13.997 --> 47:15.874
Sade, I don't make you do this often.

47:16.708 --> 47:17.584
Sorry.

47:18.168 --> 47:19.670
-Bite her.
-What? Me?

47:20.254 --> 47:21.505
Oh, my fingers. Hey!

47:26.260 --> 47:27.427
I don't bite. I swear.

47:28.470 --> 47:30.806
I know dear Sade never bites anyone.

47:30.889 --> 47:33.100
Oh, good. I was worried.

47:33.892 --> 47:37.521
No, you just paved the way for
a horde of wild dogs to rip me to shreds.

47:38.272 --> 47:39.690
Right before I was left to die.

47:39.773 --> 47:41.149
Oh. But… but… but…

47:41.233 --> 47:44.987
Help! Master! Please save me!

47:45.070 --> 47:47.906
Hey, wait a second. If you all leave me…

47:47.990 --> 47:49.867
who's going to take me out of here?

47:52.077 --> 47:55.080
-You just had to do it!
-Shall we talk about Shadi?

47:55.163 --> 47:57.165
That takes priority, wouldn't you say?

47:57.249 --> 47:59.710
-I'll keep my mouth shut, otherwise.
-Oh, you!

48:00.460 --> 48:02.880
Shadi snuck in and tied me up
with the string.

48:02.963 --> 48:05.090
I haven't seen him
since the 300-year war.

48:05.173 --> 48:06.884
He was dragging his feet with heavy steps,

48:06.967 --> 48:08.844
which means he's also tied up
with the string.

48:08.927 --> 48:10.596
He came to convey that warning.

48:11.179 --> 48:13.599
Shadi is a hostage again,
just like he was back then.

48:13.682 --> 48:16.727
You cannot lie under any circumstances,
and you know something for sure!

48:19.980 --> 48:21.690
-Was it your doing again?
-No.

48:23.025 --> 48:24.318
It was your doing.

48:24.860 --> 48:26.695
Shadi has a master,
but he's not a hostage.

48:26.778 --> 48:29.865
He chose his own master
by gifting the ring he was living in.

48:30.532 --> 48:32.451
That's all I'm saying.

48:32.534 --> 48:34.077
What're you talking about?
What'd I do?

48:34.161 --> 48:35.579
I can't hear you, not listening

48:35.662 --> 48:37.331
Yes, you heard me, you heard me

48:37.414 --> 48:40.125
La, la, la, la
Go on, go on, blah, blah

48:40.208 --> 48:41.793
I can't hear you
I can't hear you

48:45.672 --> 48:47.257
So who is Shadi's master?

48:49.051 --> 48:50.093
Smug bastard.

48:52.054 --> 48:53.639
You want to know who his master is?

48:53.722 --> 48:57.559
An immortal being.
Thanks to you. Your pride made him.

49:00.228 --> 49:02.189
Would you please save Hunbish
from the wolves?

49:03.023 --> 49:05.609
Please, let him live a long, long life.

49:06.610 --> 49:07.444
The kid?

49:34.304 --> 49:35.889
I don't even remember his face.

49:35.973 --> 49:37.933
Are you saying he's in this town
right now?

49:38.016 --> 49:40.185
No. I don't want to.
I don't know. It doesn't exist.

49:40.268 --> 49:42.187
Whatever you ask,
my answer'll be one of four--

49:42.270 --> 49:43.897
Servant of Him, Ejllael.

49:43.981 --> 49:47.025
Where is he? What color is his front door?
Tell me what his roof looks like.

49:47.109 --> 49:49.111
You're so satanic!

49:53.740 --> 49:56.076
Damn it! My shirt!

49:57.160 --> 49:58.161
Sade.

50:00.831 --> 50:04.334
Hmm. This air, the smell of blood.

50:04.418 --> 50:08.547
Isn't this where my boss died
in her past life, 983 years ago?

50:08.630 --> 50:11.633
That's right.
I made an immortal by accident.

50:13.260 --> 50:16.930
I overinterpreted that lump of clay's wish
a little, I guess.

50:18.932 --> 50:21.018
But I can't recall his face.

50:22.269 --> 50:23.770
He'll be passing by here soon.

50:24.896 --> 50:27.983
Remember his smell,
and find him upon return.

50:29.609 --> 50:31.570
I'm sure he's somewhere in Cheongpung.

51:21.078 --> 51:21.912
Huh?

51:30.128 --> 51:31.588
You're the man who saved me earlier.

51:34.216 --> 51:35.550
My name is Hunbish.

51:36.885 --> 51:37.719
Thank you, sir.

51:39.387 --> 51:41.389
Huh.

51:43.100 --> 51:44.893
You aren't thankful in the future.

51:45.477 --> 51:46.561
I don't understand.

51:47.145 --> 51:48.855
Don't try to remember my face.

51:48.939 --> 51:50.899
I'll just appear to have
a different one to you.

51:56.071 --> 51:58.573
Don't even think of doing anything
to my brother,

51:59.741 --> 52:01.243
for I will soon seek you out.
